@startuml
actor User
boundary ChangePasswordPage
control AuthController
control AuthService
database Database
control SessionController
control SessionService
control NotificationService

User -> ChangePasswordPage: Enter current password, new password, and confirm new password
User -> ChangePasswordPage: Click "Change Password" button
ChangePasswordPage -> AuthController: POST /api/auth/change-password
AuthController -> AuthService: Send change password request with current and new passwords
AuthService -> Database: Verify current password
Database --> AuthService: Return verification status
AuthService -> Database: Update to new hashed password if current password is correct
Database --> AuthService: Return update status
AuthService --> AuthController: Return result of password change request
AuthController --> ChangePasswordPage: Return result of password change request
ChangePasswordPage -> User: Display success or error message

AuthController -> SessionController: POST /api/sessions/invalidate
SessionController -> SessionService: Invalidate all active sessions
SessionService -> User: Prompt user to log in again

AuthController -> NotificationService: Send email notification of password change
NotificationService -> User: Send email notification
@enduml